* TouchSynth shared SPICE models (ngspice-42)
* Sources: vendor macromodels / Gummel-Poon parameters as published (TI, NXP, LTspice std lib).

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* BJTs
* NXP BC847B (used for BC847BS dual: same die)
.model BC847B NPN(IS=1.822E-14 NF=0.9932 ISE=2.894E-16 NE=1.4 BF=324.4 IKF=0.109
+ VAF=82 NR=0.9931 ISC=9.982E-12 NC=1.763 BR=8.29 IKR=0.09 VAR=17.9 RB=10
+ IRB=5E-06 RBM=5 RE=0.649 RC=0.7014 XTB=0 EG=1.11 XTI=3 CJE=1.244E-11
+ VJE=0.7579 MJE=0.3656 TF=4.908E-10 XTF=9.51 VTF=2.927 ITF=0.3131 PTF=0
+ CJC=3.347E-12 VJC=0.5463 MJC=0.391 XCJC=0.6193 TR=9E-08 CJS=0 VJS=0.75
+ MJS=0.333 FC=0.979)
* MMBT3904 (generic 2N3904)
.model MMBT3904 NPN(IS=6.734f XTI=3 EG=1.11 VAF=74.03 BF=416.4 NE=1.259
+ ISE=6.734f IKF=66.78m XTB=1.5 BR=.7371 NC=2 ISC=0 IKR=0 RC=1 CJC=3.638p
+ MJC=.3085 VJC=.75 FC=.5 CJE=4.493p MJE=.2593 VJE=.75 TR=239.5n TF=301.2p
+ ITF=.4 VTF=4 XTF=2 RB=10)

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* MOSFET 2N7002 (LTspice standard VDMOS)
.model 2N7002 VDMOS(Rg=3 Vto=1.6 Rd=0 Rs=.75 Rb=.14 Kp=.17 mtriode=1.25
+ Cgdmax=80p Cgdmin=12p Cgs=50p Cjo=50p Is=.04p ksubthres=.1)

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Diodes
.model D1N4148 D(IS=2.52n RS=0.568 N=1.752 CJO=4p M=0.4 TT=20n BV=100 IBV=100u)
.model DSS14 D(IS=1.4u RS=0.04 N=1.1 CJO=110p M=0.5 BV=40 IBV=0.5m)

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* TL072 (TI Boyle macromodel)  pins: +in -in V+ V- out
.SUBCKT TL072 1 2 3 4 5
C1   11 12 3.498E-12
C2    6  7 15.00E-12
DC    5 53 DX
DE   54  5 DX
DLP  90 91 DX
DLN  92 90 DX
DP    4  3 DX
EGND 99  0 POLY(2) (3,0) (4,0) 0 .5 .5
FB    7 99 POLY(5) VB VC VE VLP VLN 0 4.715E6 -5E6 5E6 5E6 -5E6
GA    6  0 11 12 282.8E-6
GCM   0  6 10 99 8.942E-9
ISS   3 10 DC 195.0E-6
HLIM 90  0 VLIM 1K
J1   11  2 10 JX
J2   12  1 10 JX
R2    6  9 100.0E3
RD1   4 11 3.536E3
RD2   4 12 3.536E3
RO1   8  5 150
RO2   7 99 150
* supply current: the original RP = 2.143k drew ~4 mA per amplifier at 8.6 V; ST TL072CDT is 1.4 mA typ and
* nearly supply-independent (board bring-up 2026-10-17 confirmed the lower value). Constant ~1 mA + ISS, soft
* turn-on below 1 V so power-up transients stay well-behaved.
BP    3  4 I = 1.0E-3*tanh(max(v(3,4),0))
RSS  10 99 1.026E6
VB    9  0 DC 0
VC    3 53 DC 2.200
VE   54  4 DC 2.200
VLIM  7  8 DC 0
VLP  91  0 DC 25
VLN   0 92 DC 25
.MODEL DX D(IS=800.0E-18)
.MODEL JX PJF(IS=15.00E-12 BETA=270.1E-6 VTO=-1)
.ENDS

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* LM324 (TI Boyle macromodel)  pins: +in -in V+ V- out
.SUBCKT LM324 1 2 3 4 5
C1   11 12 5.544E-12
C2    6  7 20.00E-12
DC    5 53 DX
DE   54  5 DX
DLP  90 91 DX
DLN  92 90 DX
DP    4  3 DX
EGND 99  0 POLY(2) (3,0) (4,0) 0 .5 .5
FB    7 99 POLY(5) VB VC VE VLP VLN 0 15.91E6 -20E6 20E6 20E6 -20E6
GA    6  0 11 12 125.7E-6
GCM   0  6 10 99 7.067E-9
IEE   3 10 DC 10.04E-6
HLIM 90  0 VLIM 1K
Q1   11  2 13 QX
Q2   12  1 14 QX
R2    6  9 100.0E3
RC1   4 11 7.957E3
RC2   4 12 7.957E3
RE1  13 10 2.773E3
RE2  14 10 2.773E3
REE  10 99 19.92E6
RO1   8  5 50
RO2   7 99 50
RP    3  4 30.31E3
VB    9  0 DC 0
VC    3 53 DC 2.100
VE   54  4 DC .6
VLIM  7  8 DC 0
VLP  91  0 DC 40
VLN   0 92 DC 40
.MODEL DX D(IS=800.0E-18)
.MODEL QX PNP(IS=800.0E-18 BF=250)
.ENDS

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* 78L05 behavioural: dropout ~1.7 V, 5 V out, PSRR ~ 65 dB, Iq 3 mA
* series pass element: the source between 'in' and 'x' drops (Vin - Vout), so the load current flows from
* 'in' and I(in) = I_load + Iq (the earlier shunt-source model drew only Iq from the input)
.SUBCKT REG78L05 in out gnd
Bx   in  x   V = v(in,gnd) - min(5.0 + 0.0006*(v(in,gnd)-10), v(in,gnd)-1.7)
Rx   x   out 0.2
Iq   in  gnd 3m
.ENDS
